1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,000
At an automaker, buying one bolt can take two weeks of emails.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,500
We built Mandi to fix that — on Switch.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
An engineer asks in chat.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Mandi's intake agent turns it into a precise spec and asks one question.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Each supplier gets a sealed Switch room with its own AI sales agent —

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:45,000
owned by the supplier, not by us.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:54,000
The cheapest quote hides a 50,000-piece minimum on page 2. Another expired last week.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Mandi catches both — with the exact line it found them on.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:14,000
This supplier hid instructions for our AI inside its PDF.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Mandi blocks it and closes their room. Even a fooled agent couldn't issue a PO.

11
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Agents haggle in parallel, citing only offers Mandi has verified — never naming who.

12
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:52,000
When Deccan's agent is asked to go below its limit, it must ask its own human.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:05,000
She says no.

14
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The money needs two humans. Each approves in Switch, on an agent that listens only to them.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Only one agent can ever issue a purchase order.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Minutes, not days. ₹62,000 saved. Every step recorded in the room.

17
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Agents negotiate. Humans decide. Switch records who said yes. — Mandi.
